I am in the corridor.
My large suitcase is here.
The suitcase is very heavy.
I pull the suitcase slowly.
My friend Asha comes there.
She sees me and smiles.
"Maya, I am helping," Asha says.
One small bag is on top of the suitcase.
Asha takes that small bag.
She carries the bag in her hand.
"Thank you, Asha," I say.
My new flat is in the same building.
We walk forward.
The new flat is at the end of the corridor.
We go near the new door.
I stand near the door.
My home is just near now.
